%% Status: CURRENT FRONTEND + BACKEND TODO FOR CODEX
%% Source: frontend/src/lib/sign-out.ts
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant SignOut as lib/sign-out.ts (signOutCompletely)
    participant Release as releaseMyRuntime (server fn, best-effort)
    participant Supa as Supabase Auth
    participant Local as sessionStorage (ai-session, admission-session, messaging-session)
    participant Sweeper as EXPECTED backend heartbeat/lease TTL sweeper (NOT IMPLEMENTED)

    User->>SignOut: sign out
    SignOut->>Release: releaseMyRuntime({leaseId}) while token still valid
    alt release fails
        Release-->>SignOut: swallowed, best-effort only
    else release succeeds
        Release-->>SignOut: released
    end
    SignOut->>Supa: auth.signOut({ scope: "local" })<br/>current session only
    SignOut->>Local: clearAiSession(), clearAdmissionSession(), clearMessagingSessionState(), clearGoogleAccess()
    Note over Sweeper: If the browser closed before release ran (crash, network loss),<br/>nothing frees the model process/VRAM, session CPU/context RAM or temp artifacts.
    Sweeper-->>Sweeper: BACKEND TODO FOR CODEX — heartbeat/lease-TTL expiry cleanup does not exist yet.
